{"page":23,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:146","surah":2,"ayah":146,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلَّذِينَ ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ يَعْرِفُونَهُۥ كَمَا يَعْرِفُونَ أَبْنَآءَهُمْ ۖ وَإِنَّ فَرِيقًا مِّنْهُمْ لَيَكْتُمُونَ ٱلْحَقَّ وَهُمْ يَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Those We gave Scripture know it as well as they know their own sons, but some of them hide the truth that they know.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"(To) those whom","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:146"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُمُ","en_gloss":"We gave [them]","transliteration":"ātaynāhumu","verse_key":"2:146"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"2:146"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَعْرِفُونَهُۥ","en_gloss":"they recognize it","transliteration":"yaʿrifūnahu","verse_key":"2:146"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كَمَا","en_gloss":"like","transliteration":"kamā","verse_key":"2:146"},{"pos":6,"ar":"يَعْرِفُونَ","en_gloss":"they recognize","transliteration":"yaʿrifūna","verse_key":"2:146"},{"pos":7,"ar":"أَبْنَآءَهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"their sons","transliteration":"abnāahum","verse_key":"2:146"},{"pos":8,"ar":"وَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"And indeed","transliteration":"wa-inna","verse_key":"2:146"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فَرِيقًۭا","en_gloss":"a group","transliteration":"farīqan","verse_key":"2:146"},{"pos":10,"ar":"مِّنْهُمْ","en_gloss":"of them","transliteration":"min'hum","verse_key":"2:146"},{"pos":11,"ar":"لَيَكْتُمُونَ","en_gloss":"surely they conceal","transliteration":"layaktumūna","verse_key":"2:146"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْحَقَّ","en_gloss":"the Truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqa","verse_key":"2:146"},{"pos":13,"ar":"وَهُمْ","en_gloss":"while they","transliteration":"wahum","verse_key":"2:146"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"yaʿlamūna","verse_key":"2:146"},{"pos":15,"ar":"١٤٦","en_gloss":"(146)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:146"}]},{"verse_key":"2:147","surah":2,"ayah":147,"ar_uthmani":"ٱلْحَقُّ مِن رَّبِّكَ ۖ فَلَا تَكُونَنّ